## Findings (ranked)

- **F14 (CRIT) — Phantom stdlib path claims:** `audit/std_caps_batch_2.oot` claimed net servers migrated under `std/src/net/`. Only `dns.oo` exists. **CLOSED:** `std_caps_batch_2.oot` deleted; closed in `audit/f14_phantom_net_close.oot` + `f14_domain_a.oot`.
- **F10 (HIGH) — FsReadCap may authorize write:** NOT_A_BUG. `sealed_fs_kind_of` maps write to FsWriteCap. `oodac check` returns rc=1; runtime `require_fswrite` rejects `g_tok_fsread`. Verified in `cap_g2_fs_granular_smoke.oo`. Closed in `audit/f10_cap_stale.oot`.
- **F11 (HIGH) — FsWriteCap may authorize read:** NOT_A_BUG. FsWriteCap ↛ `read_file` (prefer FsReadCap). Verified with `wrong_granular_fswrite_for_read.oo`. Closed in `audit/f10_cap_stale.oot`.
- **F12 (HIGH) — HttpCap may authorize raw:** NOT_A_BUG. `sock_raw` maps to NetCap. HttpCap ↛ `tcp_bind`/`sock_raw`. Verified in `cap_g1_net_granular_smoke.oo`.
- **F43 (MED) — No `sock_raw` fail-closed fixture:** `sealed_net_kind_of` maps `sock_raw` → NetCap; residual fixture `wrong_granular_http_for_sock_raw.oo` recommended.
- **F44 (HIGH) — Cap-smoke scripts reference phantom `.md` files:** 3 smokes grepped `.md` for `STATIC_CAPS` / `CAP_FFI`. **CLOSED:** updated to grep `.oot`. Smokes PASS dual-green.
- **F45 (HIGH) — `std/os/process.oo:58:12` undefined `sys_args`:** **CLOSED:** restated as runtime require; `oodac check std/os/process.oo` OK; `cap_process_facade_smoke.oo` PASS.
- **F46 (CRIT) — `chs_rt_sys.c:437` C syntax error:** Extra brace in `fetch` body. **CLOSED:** extra `}` removed; `gcc -c ooda/runtime/chs_rt_sys.c` exit 0; `cap_ffi_runtime_smoke.oo` PASS.

